# Title: Potential Arbitrary File Download Using Office Application
# ID: 4ae3e30b-b03f-43aa-87e3-b622f4048eed
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems), Beyu Denis, oscd.community
# Date: 2022-05-17
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1202
# Description: Detects potential arbitrary file download using a Microsoft Office application
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((cmdline:*http://* OR cmdline:*https://*)) AND (((process_name:*\\EXCEL.EXE OR process_name:*\\MSOXMLED.EXE OR process_name:*\\POWERPNT.EXE OR process_name:*\\WINWORD.exe)) OR ((OriginalFileName:"Excel.exe" OR OriginalFileName:"msoxmled.exe" OR OriginalFileName:"POWERPNT.EXE" OR OriginalFileName:"WinWord.exe"))))
